{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "獨詞三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦須\n教依名運念，令罪消滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須一一釋對破，以故知無始障不可率除，如伐樹得根、灸病得穴，故須逆順觀其罪\n由，其罪性空方為永謝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具列十惡五逆四重無因果相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具足為說發四弘心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應答云：無。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須具為說緣境，為發戒緣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三問三答"}
